<title>UK: De La Rue shares gain after BZW upgrade.</title>
<headline>De La Rue shares gain after BZW upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in De La Rue Plc rose on Thursday as analysts at BZW raised the stock to a &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell,&quot; dealers said.</p>
<p>Shares in the banknote printer were up 3-1/2p at 577-1/2 by 1239 GMT.</p>
<p>Sources said BZW analysts pointed out that the newsflow from De La Rue may be about to improve and that they would not be surprised to see some recovery in the shares.</p>
<p>BZW analysts were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
